  "body": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Boiled bacon and cabbage is a cured bacon joint simmered slowly in water with vegetables. It is served with the cooking cabbage, carrots, and a parsley sauce made from the cooking liquid. The joint needs a long, gentle simmer. Rush it and the meat stays tough."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
